  "protocol": 32,
  "scope": "Bounded squad gunshot attention and ordinary-input combined hostile squad/breach QA. Full vertical-slice goal remains active.",
  "evidence_root": "build/swat/review/squad-fire/",
  "changes": [
    "Officers consume propagated shot cues, orient toward their coarse bearing for at most 90 ticks and retain physical formation movement. Hearing supplies no actor identity or hidden position.",
    "Hands-on restraint/retrieval pauses during gunshot attention and resumes afterward. Visible-target rules retain firing-line and civilian protection; attention expires through stun.",
    "QA commander reacts to observed gunfire and visible raised weapons aimed at the team, retains observed threat status while visible and armed, aims at the exposed perception point and uses existing slow formation pace during hostile delegated-task runs. These are QA inputs, not game player assistance.",
    "QA holds the team outside the planned charge exposure, covers the aperture after detonation and recalls officers afterward. Protected casualties now fail immediately with a closed diagnostic journal."
  ],
