    "interpretation": "Original v31 combined run loses commander at tick 4429. Faster follower experiment produced route churn and was removed. Slow QA route exposed officer 3 casualty at 11647; the stricter guard now stops there. Sight-line trace shows officer 3 occluding the commander after the first exchange; breach QA now holds the team at extraction and the commander covers the opening before/after triggering. Further trials lost an exposed officer at 11683 and the isolated commander at 9883; QA then added observable raised-weapon threat response. One UDP synchronization failure under concurrent work is retained; final checks are separate from adverse-load/packet-loss qualification. Do not count these failed trials as accepted runs."
